Upstream-Name: speech-dispatcher-modules
Upstream-Contact: Grigory Tuboltsev <gtubolcev@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/gtubolcev/linux-tts

Files: *
Copyright: 2026 Grigory Tuboltsev
License: MIT

Files: vosk/vosk.c
Copyright: 2026 Grigory Tuboltsev
License: MIT
Comment: A C port of the Python vosk_tts package of Alpha Cephei
 (Apache-2.0).

Files: kokoro/*
Copyright: 2026 Grigory Tuboltsev
License: MIT
Comment: ru-g2p.c is a port of ru_g2p.py of zaakirio/kokoro-ru (Apache-2.0),
 of misaki's espeak front end (Apache-2.0) and of the punctuation handling of
 phonemizer (GPL-3+). sd_kokoro links with libespeak-ng (GPL-3+), so the
 binary as a whole is distributed under GPL-3+.

Files: kokoro/espeak-ru/*
Copyright: espeak-ng contributors
License: GPL-3+
Comment: ru_rules, ru_list and ru_emoji of espeak-ng master (688cb60),
 which honour the stress mark U+0301; compiled into ru_dict at build time.

Files: teratts/teratts.c
Copyright: 2026 Grigory Tuboltsev
License: MIT
Comment: Follows teratts.py of TeraSpace/TeraTTSv2 (the text preparation
 and the order of its four ONNX graphs).

Files: speechd-module/*
Copyright: 2020-2025 Samuel Thibault <samuel.thibault@ens-lyon.org>
License: BSD-2-Clause
Comment: The module library of speech-dispatcher 0.12.1, built only where
 speech-dispatcher does not install it (before 0.12.0).

